        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\n\nactor \&quot;Khách hàng\&quot; as KH\nactor \&quot;Nhân viên bán vé\&quot; as NVBV\nactor \&quot;Nhân viên soát vé\&quot; as NVSV\n\nrectangle \&quot;Hệ thống bán vé &amp; soát vé xem phim tại quầy\&quot; {\n\n  usecase \&quot;nhập vào hệ thống\&quot; as UC0\n\n  usecase \&quot;mua vé xem phim tại quầy\&quot; as UC1\n  usecase \&quot;Chọn suất chiếu\&quot; as UC2\n  usecase \&quot;Chọn ghế\&quot; as UC3\n  usecase \&quot;Thanh toán\&quot; as UC4\n  usecase \&quot;In vé\&quot; as UC5\n\n  usecase \&quot;Soát vé xem phim\&quot; as UC6\n  usecase \&quot;Quét mã vé\&quot; as UC7\n  usecase \&quot;Kiểm tra vé hợp lệ\&quot; as UC8\n  usecase \&quot;Cho phép vào rạp\&quot; as UC9\n}\n\nKH --&gt; UC1\n\nNVBV --&gt; UC1\nNVBV --&gt; UC0\n\nNVSV --&gt; UC6\nNVSV --&gt; UC0\n\nUC1 ..&gt; UC2 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; UC3 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; UC4 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; UC5 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC1 ..&gt; UC0 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\nUC6 ..&gt; UC7 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC6 ..&gt; UC8 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC6 ..&gt; UC9 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC6 ..&gt; UC0 : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="ezM7Nh7Z7T6OaQ9INB7v-1">
